# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# All variables below are OPTIONAL.
# The skills work in draft-only mode with nothing set: they write the
# caption, hook, hashtags, and slide plan for you to post in the app.
# Add a PUBLORA_API_KEY to auto-upload your media and schedule posts.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------

# Publora API key - sign up free at https://app.publora.com/signup
PUBLORA_API_KEY=sk_your_key_here

# Instagram platform connection ID (format: instagram-11223344)
# Find this in the Publora dashboard: Channels then your Instagram account.
# Copy the whole thing including the instagram- prefix.
# Instagram requires a Business or Creator account (personal is not supported).
INSTAGRAM_PLATFORM_ID=instagram-your_id_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Apify token (optional) - if you later wire an Instagram-reading actor,
# the read-side skills can fetch a post's caption instead of asking you
# to paste it. Without a token, ig-hook-extractor falls back to asking
# you to paste the caption.
#
# Sign up: https://console.apify.com/sign-up
# Token:   https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
APIFY_TOKEN=apify_api_your_token_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Advanced (Tier 2): if you've built your own poster with Claude Code or Codex
# (e.g. on the Instagram Graph API), set this to the command the skills invoke
# on approval. Leave unset unless you actually have a custom poster working.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# INSTAGRAM_SKILLS_CUSTOM_POSTER=python /path/to/my-poster.py

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pixfaro token (optional) - lets the skills generate illustrations for
# posts (feed images, carousel slides, quote-cards) and attach them on
# publish. Returns a hosted URL that flows straight into Publora media.
# Pixel-exact text/logo overlay keeps every asset on-brand.
#
# Sign up + docs: https://pixfaro.com  (key format: pf_live_...)
#
# Without a token, the skills draft the image prompt and ask you to
# generate it yourself and paste the URL.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PIXFARO_TOKEN=pf_live_your_token_here
